# Chain of Smog: "Target player discards two cards" discards the whole hand if it has fewer (CR 701.9), and the player
# still "may copy this spell". Bot1 casts it at itself on turn 3 with five cards left in hand and keeps the target for
# each copy: 5 -> 3 -> 1 -> 0 (one card discarded) -> 0 (nothing to discard, the copy is still offered) and then
# declines. The copies are not cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Chain of Smog
Swamp x6
Swamp x10

